WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
From Triangle, bend the front knee and walk the bottom hand forward onto a block.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Shift weight onto the front foot and float the back leg parallel to the floor.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Stack the hips and open the chest, top arm reaching up.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Find a steady gaze. Switch sides.
